# Expert Systems and Document Handling.

**Authors:** Edmonds, Ernest

## Abstract
Describes significant attributes of expert systems, contrasts them to conventional computer systems, and provides an overview of the R1 expert system used by Digital Equipment Corporation (DEC) to put together operational systems that meet customers' requirements. Document handling, particularly pictures and images in documents, is also briefly discussed. (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ351268

